  m_text: 'Your game lives in Assets/_Project.


    Features/Sample is a feature
    module: copy the folder, rename Sample in its files and asmdefs, and add its
    installer to App/Game/GameInstaller.cs between the cmpose:features markers.


    README.md
    covers builds, signing and deep links.'
